LocLongDescription="Allows the user to scale vertical surfaces quickly. Can be used <Ability:TR_RockClimb_NumCharge_Ability></Ability:TR_RockClimb_NumCharge_Ability/> times per mission, with a recharge time of <Ability:TR_RockClimb_Cooldown_Ability/> turns. Each use costs <Ability:TR_RockClimb_AP_Cost_Ability/> action points. "
